message: "If you use FastFusion-IF, please cite this software."
title: "FastFusion-IF"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21652863"
date-released: 2026-07-28

authors:
  - given-names: "Nima"
    family-names: "Mahmoudi"
    affiliation: "University of Science and Technology of Mazandaran"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"

abstract: >-
  FastFusion-IF is a partner-blind protein-protein interface prediction
  method that predicts residue-level interface probabilities from a single
  protein chain by combining atomic geometry, molecular-surface information,
  and residue-level evolutionary and structural profiles.

keywords:
  - protein-protein interface prediction
  - protein structure
  - geometric deep learning
  - molecular surface
  - deep learning

license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nimahmoodi1/fastfusion-if"
